[thin] This is the full 2 mm TPU sealing sheet between the rigid plate and countertop, with open shank and rear bundle passages. The thin reading is its specified axial thickness. The centered gasket is unprinted; sealing compression and clamp capacity remain unqualified.
alternatives: A thicker gasket increases the mounting-stack height and changes donor thread engagement and compression. A thinner sheet reduces compliance. The 2 mm sheet follows the matching plate perimeter and existing stack height.
